            <Val><![CDATA[GitHub 的存放庫 URL 必須符合以下格式: https://github.com/owner/repo-name，對於 Azure DevOps，則應為: https://dev.azure.com/organization/project/_git/repository-name 或 https://organization.visualstudio.com/project/_git/repository-name]]></Val>
          </Tgt>
        </Str>
        <Disp Icon="Str" />
      </Item>
